[[4,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the oil pump complete with engine oil intake duct.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179003451.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the engine oil pump fitting it on the driven gear on the chain and tighten the bolts to the recommended torque.</p>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the oil pump.</p><p>2. Release the pulley from the drive chain (2a) and remove the oil pump (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179003452.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Place the oil pump in position fitting the pulley on the drive chain.</p><p>- Tighten the bolts fixing the oil pump to the balancing shaft assembly and tighten to torque.</p>"]]